              "value": "Leads to: Medic Dedication|APG, Doctor's Visitation|APG, Resuscitate|APG, Treat Condition|APG, Holistic Care|APG, Preventative Treatment|LOKL, Godless Healing|LOWG, Mortal Healing|LOGM, Paragon Battle Medicine|LOL"
